{"seq":3,"slug":"migration-strategies","title":"迁移策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/evolution/migration-strategies","wordCount":1749,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"迁移策略\">迁移策略</h1><p>兼容性规则告诉你&quot;这个变更不兼容&quot;，Registry 在注册时把它拦住——然后呢？业务需求不会因为&quot;不兼容&quot;就消失。类型必须从 <code>string</code> 改成 <code>int</code>，字段必须重命名，嵌套结构必须重组。迁移策略回答的就是：<strong>当不兼容变更不可避免时，如何做到零停机、零数据丢失地完成过渡</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>迁移策略回答&quot;不兼容变更不可避免时如何零停机、零数据丢失地过渡&quot;</strong>，把一次破坏性变更分解为多步兼容变更序列。</li>\n<li><strong>破坏性变更按影响面分级</strong>：L1 字段重命名（映射层可解决）、L2 类型变更（需数据转换）、L3 结构重组（需多步迁移）。</li>\n<li><strong>Expand-and-Contract 是最通用的模式</strong>：先扩展（新旧字段共存）、再迁移（双写 + 消费者逐步切换）、最后收缩（移除旧字段），每一步单独看都通过兼容性检查。</li>\n<li><strong>核心约束是&quot;读取时新旧共存&quot;</strong>：数据流的已发送消息不可变，无法像数据库那样 <code>UPDATE</code> 存量，所以迁移必须先保证任何版本的 schema 都能成功反序列化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"破坏性变更的分类\">破坏性变更的分类</h2><p>不是所有不兼容变更的迁移路径都一样。按影响面和难度分为三级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>变更类型</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>迁移复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 轻度</td>\n<td>字段重命名</td>\n<td><code>user_name</code> → <code>username</code></td>\n<td>低——映射层可解决</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 中度</td>\n<td>类型变更</td>\n<td><code>amount: string</code> → <code>amount: long</code></td>\n<td>中——需数据转换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 重度</td>\n<td>结构重组</td>\n<td>拆分/合并 record、嵌套层级变化</td>\n<td>高——需多步迁移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"expand-and-contract-模式\">Expand-and-Contract 模式</h2><p>这是最通用、最安全的迁移模式。核心思想：<strong>先扩展（新旧共存），再收缩（移除旧的）</strong>。整个过程分三步，每一步都是兼容性检查可通过的变更。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Phase1: 1. Expand - 新增字段&#10;    Phase1 --&gt; Phase2: 2. Migrate - 双写期&#10;    Phase2 --&gt; Phase3: 3. Contract - 移除旧字段&#10;    Phase3 --&gt; [*]&#10;&#10;    state Phase1 {&#10;        [*] --&gt; AddNew: 新增目标字段(可选,有默认值)&#10;        AddNew --&gt; BothExist: schema 现有新旧两个字段&#10;    }&#10;    state Phase2 {&#10;        [*] --&gt; DualWrite: 生产者同时写新旧字段&#10;        DualWrite --&gt; ConsumerMigrate: 消费者逐步迁移到新字段&#10;        ConsumerMigrate --&gt; AllMigrated: 所有消费者已使用新字段&#10;    }&#10;    state Phase3 {&#10;        [*] --&gt; RemoveOld: 移除旧字段&#10;        RemoveOld --&gt; Done: schema 只保留新字段&#10;    }\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Phase1: 1. Expand - 新增字段\n    Phase1 --&gt; Phase2: 2. Migrate - 双写期\n    Phase2 --&gt; Phase3: 3. Contract - 移除旧字段\n    Phase3 --&gt; [*]\n\n    state Phase1 {\n        [*] --&gt; AddNew: 新增目标字段(可选,有默认值)\n        AddNew --&gt; BothExist: schema 现有新旧两个字段\n    }\n    state Phase2 {\n        [*] --&gt; DualWrite: 生产者同时写新旧字段\n        DualWrite --&gt; ConsumerMigrate: 消费者逐步迁移到新字段\n        ConsumerMigrate --&gt; AllMigrated: 所有消费者已使用新字段\n    }\n    state Phase3 {\n        [*] --&gt; RemoveOld: 移除旧字段\n        RemoveOld --&gt; Done: schema 只保留新字段\n    }</pre><p><strong>示例：将 <code>amount_str</code>（string &quot;19.99&quot;）改为 <code>amount_cents</code>（long 1999）</strong></p>\n<p>步骤 1 — Expand：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&quot;name&quot;: &quot;amount_str&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;},&#10;{&quot;name&quot;: &quot;amount_cents&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: [&quot;null&quot;, &quot;long&quot;], &quot;default&quot;: null}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"amount_str\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"amount_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"null\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"long\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这是一个 BACKWARD 兼容的变更（新增带默认值的可选字段）。</p>\n<p>步骤 2 — Migrate：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生产者升级：同时写 <code>amount_str</code> 和 <code>amount_cents</code></li>\n<li>消费者逐步升级：切换到读 <code>amount_cents</code></li>\n<li>监控确认：所有消费者都已迁移完成</li>\n</ul>\n<p>步骤 3 — Contract：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{ &quot;name&quot;: &quot;amount_cents&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;long&quot; }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"amount_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"long\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>删除 <code>amount_str</code>。在 BACKWARD 模式下，删除带默认值的字段是兼容的。</p>\n<p><strong>关键保证</strong>：每一步单独来看都通过兼容性检查。即使某个消费者在迁移期间宕机重启，它拿到的任何版本的 schema 都能成功反序列化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"版本化-topic-表策略\">版本化 Topic/表策略</h2><p>当变更太剧烈（如完全重设计一个事件结构），Expand-and-Contract 的&quot;共存期&quot;可能过长或不可行。此时直接创建新 topic/表，走并行运行 + 消费者迁移的路径。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 旧世界&#10;        OT[order-events-v1] --&gt; OC1[消费者 A v1]&#10;        OT --&gt; OC2[消费者 B v1]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 过渡期&#10;        OT2[order-events-v1] --&gt; Bridge[迁移桥&lt;br/&gt;读 v1 转写 v2]&#10;        Bridge --&gt; NT[order-events-v2]&#10;        NT --&gt; NC1[消费者 A v2]&#10;        OT2 --&gt; OC2b[消费者 B v1&lt;br/&gt;尚未迁移]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 新世界&#10;        P2[生产者 v2] --&gt; NT2[order-events-v2]&#10;        NT2 --&gt; NC2[消费者 A v2]&#10;        NT2 --&gt; NC3[消费者 B v2]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 旧世界\n        OT[order-events-v1] --&gt; OC1[消费者 A v1]\n        OT --&gt; OC2[消费者 B v1]\n    end\n    subgraph 过渡期\n        OT2[order-events-v1] --&gt; Bridge[迁移桥&lt;br/&gt;读 v1 转写 v2]\n        Bridge --&gt; NT[order-events-v2]\n        NT --&gt; NC1[消费者 A v2]\n        OT2 --&gt; OC2b[消费者 B v1&lt;br/&gt;尚未迁移]\n    end\n    subgraph 新世界\n        P2[生产者 v2] --&gt; NT2[order-events-v2]\n        NT2 --&gt; NC2[消费者 A v2]\n        NT2 --&gt; NC3[消费者 B v2]\n    end</pre><p><strong>操作流程</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>创建新 topic <code>order-events-v2</code>（新 schema，独立 subject）</li>\n<li>部署迁移桥：消费 v1 → 转换 → 写入 v2</li>\n<li>新消费者直接连 v2；旧消费者按计划迁移</li>\n<li>所有消费者迁移完成后，停止 v1 生产者和迁移桥</li>\n<li>保留 v1 topic 数据到 retention 过期（或按合规要求）</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>代价</strong>：运维复杂度高（两套 topic 并行）、数据一致性需要保证（迁移桥的 exactly-once）、迁移窗口期有成本。适合大版本升级（一年一次级别）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"双写双读策略\">双写双读策略</h2><p>类似版本化 topic，但不创建新 topic，而是在应用层做路由。生产者同时产出新旧两种格式，消费者根据自己的能力选择读哪种。</p>\n<p>适用场景：无法新建 topic（基础设施限制）或变更影响面太广需要极长的过渡期。</p>\n<p>核心约束：双写期间必须保证两种格式语义等价。设旧格式为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，新格式为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，双写必须满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>Messages</mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>semantics</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>semantics</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall m \\in \\text{Messages}: \\text{semantics}(m|_{S_1}) = \\text{semantics}(m|_{S_2})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Messages</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0001em;vertical-align:-0.2501em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">semantics</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0001em;vertical-align:-0.2501em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">semantics</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>否则就是在制造分歧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"schema-registry-迁移规则\">Schema Registry 迁移规则</h2><p>Confluent Schema Registry 7.4+ 支持在 schema 定义中内嵌 migration rules——用声明式表达&quot;从版本 A 到版本 B 的转换逻辑&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;schema&quot;: &quot;...&quot;,&#10;  &quot;metadata&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;properties&quot;: { &quot;owner&quot;: &quot;order-team&quot; }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;ruleSet&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;migrationRules&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;name&quot;: &quot;upgradeAmountToV2&quot;,&#10;        &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;TRANSFORM&quot;,&#10;        &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;UPGRADE&quot;,&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;JSONATA&quot;,&#10;        &quot;expr&quot;: &quot;$ ~&gt; |$|{&#39;amount_cents&#39;: $number(amount_str) * 100}|&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;name&quot;: &quot;downgradeAmountToV1&quot;,&#10;        &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;TRANSFORM&quot;,&#10;        &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;DOWNGRADE&quot;,&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;JSONATA&quot;,&#10;        &quot;expr&quot;: &quot;$ ~&gt; |$|{&#39;amount_str&#39;: $string(amount_cents / 100)}|&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    ]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"metadata\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"properties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"owner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order-team\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ruleSet\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"migrationRules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"upgradeAmountToV2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"TRANSFORM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"UPGRADE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"JSONATA\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"expr\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"$ ~> |$|{'amount_cents': $number(amount_str) * 100}|\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"downgradeAmountToV1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"TRANSFORM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DOWNGRADE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"JSONATA\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"expr\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"$ ~> |$|{'amount_str': $string(amount_cents / 100)}|\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>消费者声明自己理解的版本，序列化器/反序列化器在读取时自动应用 upgrade/downgrade 链。这把迁移逻辑从散落在应用代码中提升到 schema 层集中管理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据库-schema-迁移的借鉴\">数据库 Schema 迁移的借鉴</h2><p>数据库领域的 schema 迁移（Flyway、Liquibase、Atlas）已经有成熟的实践模式，对数据流迁移有直接借鉴意义：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据库实践</th>\n<th>数据流对应</th>\n<th>关键差异</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>ALTER TABLE ADD COLUMN</code></td>\n<td>新增可选字段</td>\n<td>数据流无法修改已发送的消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Online Schema Change (gh-ost)</td>\n<td>Expand-and-Contract</td>\n<td>数据流的&quot;旧数据&quot;可能永远存在于 retention 内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blue-Green Deploy</td>\n<td>版本化 Topic</td>\n<td>数据流需要回放历史消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rollback migration</td>\n<td>Schema 版本回退</td>\n<td>数据流需要考虑已写入新格式的消息</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>核心差异：数据库可以&quot;改存量&quot;（<code>UPDATE</code> 所有行），数据流的已发送消息不可变。因此数据流迁移的核心约束是&quot;新旧版本必须在读取时共存&quot;，而非&quot;一次性全量转换&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"迁移决策树\">迁移决策树</h2><p>面对一个不兼容变更，按以下路径选择策略：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>变更范围有多大？</strong> 单字段变更 → Expand-and-Contract。整体重设计 → 版本化 Topic。</li>\n<li><strong>消费者数量多少？</strong> 少量已知消费者 → 协调迁移窗口。大量未知消费者 → 需要长过渡期 + 自助迁移。</li>\n<li><strong>是否有 Registry 迁移规则支持？</strong> 有 → 用声明式转换减少应用侧代码。无 → 应用层双写。</li>\n<li><strong>数据保留期多长？</strong> 短保留（7天）→ 等旧数据过期后收缩。长保留（永久）→ 需要回填或转换存量。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>无论选择哪种策略，核心原则不变：<strong>每一步都必须是可验证的、可回滚的，且在整个过渡期内数据不丢不错</strong>。验证的自动化方法，见 <a href=\"../validation/contract-testing\">契约测试</a>。如何在 CI/CD 中检测哪些变更需要走迁移路径，见 <a href=\"../validation/breaking-change-detection\">破坏性变更检测</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>迁移策略把&quot;不兼容&quot;从死路变成可执行的多步兼容序列；破坏性变更按 L1/L2/L3 分级对应不同复杂度。</li>\n<li>Expand-and-Contract 是最通用最安全的模式：Expand（加新字段）→ Migrate（双写 + 消费者切换）→ Contract（删旧字段），每步都通过兼容性检查，消费者任何时刻都能成功反序列化。</li>\n<li>变更太剧烈时改用版本化 Topic 或双写双读：前者隔离性最高但运维复杂，后者适合无法新建 topic 的场景，核心约束是双写期间两种格式语义必须等价。</li>\n<li>Registry 迁移规则用声明式表达式在 schema 层集中管理 upgrade/downgrade，避免转换逻辑散落应用代码。</li>\n<li>数据库迁移实践（gh-ost、Blue-Green）可借鉴，但关键差异是数据流的已发送消息不可变，因此核心约束是&quot;读取时新旧共存&quot;而非&quot;一次性全量转换&quot;。</li>\n<li>无论哪种策略，迁移决策按变更范围、消费者数量、Registry 支持、数据保留期四问来选路。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"迁移策略","id":"迁移策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"破坏性变更的分类","id":"破坏性变更的分类"},{"level":2,"text":"Expand-and-Contract 模式","id":"expand-and-contract-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"版本化 Topic/表策略","id":"版本化-topic-表策略"},{"level":2,"text":"双写双读策略","id":"双写双读策略"},{"level":2,"text":"Schema Registry 迁移规则","id":"schema-registry-迁移规则"},{"level":2,"text":"数据库 Schema 迁移的借鉴","id":"数据库-schema-迁移的借鉴"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移决策树","id":"迁移决策树"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Schema Registry 注册中心","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/evolution/schema-registry"},"next":{"title":"契约测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/validation/contract-testing"}}